    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests that {@link Symmetry454Date#of(int, int, int)} rejects invalid year/month/day combinations by throwing {@link DateTimeException}. <p>In the Symmetry454 calendar: <ul> <li>Valid months are 1–12.</li> <li>Short months (1, 3, 4, 6, 7, 9, 10) have 28 days; long months (2, 5, 8, 11) have 35 days.</li> <li>Month 12 has 28 days in a normal year and 35 days in a leap year.</li> </ul>"
   },
